<h2>1° La bona viuda (2 cantos)</h2>
<h3>La jolie veuve (2 chants) * The pretty widow (2 songs)</h3>
<TABLE BORDER=1 width=90%>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th colspan=2 align=center>CATALAN
<th colspan=2 align=center>FRANCAIS
